cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Bondamino in published work, please cite it as below, together with the data
  sources behind your results (see CITATION.md).
type: software
title: "Bondamino: interactive analysis of bond geometry in protein structures"
abstract: >-
  Bondamino is a web application that reads protein structures in PDB format and shows bond
  lengths, bond angles, dihedral angles and the Ramachandran plot as interactive graphs, with
  statistics against published reference values (Engh & Huber 2001, CCP4 Monomer Library,
  Top8000), exports and shared work groups.
authors:
  - family-names: Kittler
    given-names: Philipp
repository-code: "https://gitlab.com/d11m-group/bondamino"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - protein structure
  - structure validation
  - bond lengths
  - bond angles
  - Ramachandran plot
  - Protein Data Bank
